    // THE CUTTER (cutter-1118), 11-18 (Opus; tools/folk-costume-sheet.py guard, guardfight; deep16/art/folk{man,woman}_guard_p1, guard_p2, guardwoman_p1; data/foes.js guard): the guard redrawn, and its fight figures
